: a sequence of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"EdgeBreadthFirstSearchEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s, in the order ","type":"text"},{"code":"BreadthFirstSearch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reports them. Parallel edges","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are told apart, and a weight or other per-edge value is read at the position given. It holds a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copy of the graph, so later changes to the original do not affect it, and it can be iterated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"more than once."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"EdgeBreadthFirstSearch","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"EdgeBreadthFirstSearch","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/traversal\/edgebreadthfirstsearch","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeBreadthFirstSearch","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EdgeBreadthFirstSearch","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Traversal/documentation/Traversal/UndirectedSimplePaths":{"title":"UndirectedSimplePaths","url":"\/documentation\/traversal\/undirectedsimplepaths","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/UndirectedSimplePaths","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UndirectedSimplePaths","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UndirectedSimplePaths","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Every simple path of an undirected graph from a source to any of a set of targets, lazily, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the order a depth-first search from the source, taking edges in ","type":"text"},{"code":"incidentEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, reaches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"them. Each path is listed once, from the source; each copy of a parallel edge gives a different"},